	<!-- Braille keyboard gestures screen -->
	<string name="gestos_braille_titulo">Braille keyboard gestures</string>
	<string name="gestos_braille_explicacion">Each row is a gesture and what it does. Tap one to change it. Dot gestures start with the finger on that dot; if they have nothing, they do what the one-finger gesture in that direction does. In the keyboard menus and lists the gestures are always the same: one finger sideways, move; one finger up or down, change group; two fingers down, choose; two up, leave; two to the right, favourite.</string>
